# Cloud fetches Astrologian's Planisphere and equips it ({2}). Its granted triggered ability ("Whenever you cast a
# noncreature spell ... put a +1/+1 counter on this creature") is a triggered ability of Cloud, which is equipped, so it
# triggers an additional time (CR 603.2d): casting Mox Pearl puts two counters on Cloud, making it 4/3. Casting
# Planisphere itself while Cloud was not yet equipped put none.

